warrants of $370,288, offset by repayments of notes payable of $660,000, payments for deferred offering costs of $1,078,967, funds
provided for a note receivable of $1,000,000 and repayments of related party loans of $425,241. Net cash provided by financing
activities for the nine months ended March 31, 2025 consisted of proceeds from a related party loan of $332,193, an advance on
