</div><div><a id="a_005"></a></div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>ITEM 3. QUANTITATIVE AND QUALITATIVE DISCLOSURES ABOUT MARKET RISK.</b></p><div>

